 "notes": "sql: every file of data/sql, applied per database in the stages base, updates, custom, each in name order (create: the database itself; archive: kept for history, never applied). A published file never changes; a change comes as a new file. large: over 30 MB, also attached to the release. new_keys / changed_defaults: playerbots.conf.dist against the previous release; a key missing from a server's playerbots.conf takes the default of the code, equal to the .dist. components: the parts of a full SquidBots install and the tags released together (empty tag: not given for this release). races: the keys a race page writes and the module's own race defaults. optional_core_headers: headers the module uses when the core has them, with a fallback otherwise: the module builds on the official core without any of them. commit = the commit the files were read from; the build itself is identified by its tag.",
